- **Vehicles**:
  - **Vehicle_A** (white SUV, right lane, moving forward)
  - **Vehicle_B** (black SUV, left lane, moving forward)
- **Road Infrastructure**:
  - **Bridge** (overhead structure with beams)
  - **Road Markings** (double yellow lines, lane divisions)
